    "request_budget": {
      "status": "supported_interface_not_executed",
      "call_shape": "transfer(sender, receiver_callback, request, budget=B, reasoning=None, representation=..., record_selection=True)",
      "request": [
        "request为非空string或int64[1,tokens]，string按sender tokenizer加特殊token=False编码。",
        "CacheBack在private sender cache后以位置T..T+R-1 forward请求，读取各层request attention；T+R必须在context limit内。",
        "不会自动读取receiver私有cache；接收方持有的证据只能由应用显式编码进request，再公平提供给文本和其他选择器。",
        "低层Delivery.request是元数据；for_hf只返回选中行，应用须追加相同receiver指令/请求。HFReceiver会准备history+request与assistant prefix。",
        "同一request的selection在所有receiver间复用；不同receiver持有证据干预须用不同request/独立transfer，不能误用广播。"
      ],
      "budget": [
        "默认ratio=4；显式budget与ratio互斥。",
        "bound=min(B,T)，relative=I+ceil((T-I)/r)，均以position计，非字节。",
        "HFReceiver减去其history+request+output allowance，可能把预算进一步缩小；必须记录拟合后的实际budget。",
        "默认CacheBack span_size=16，以均分span score排序、保首位置及当前latent tail，恰好填预算；预算>=T会直接返回全部位置并跳过选择forward。",
        "预先核对sender与receiver各自context limit，不允许靠静默截断达预算。"
